            <ArticleTitle>Body image: a selective review of existing measurement techniques.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>225-33</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A selective review of studies concerning body image is presented to illustrate the diversity of approaches which have been adopted. Equivocal definitions of the concept of body image and the difficulties inherent in its measurement are examined and the most popular measurement techniques are described and criticized.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
